  "description": "Step into the underground world of rail transport, now more immersive than ever. With upgraded environments, redesigned stations, and enhanced routes, the experience of driving a subway train feels smoother, richer, and more realistic.\n\nTake the controls of a passenger train and experience what it’s like to be a real subway driver. Explore updated metro lines, pass through improved stations, and enjoy a more detailed and dynamic underground network designed for deeper immersion.\n\nStart your journey by choosing your favorite train and learning how to master its controls. Progress through different levels, improve your driving skills, and discover how engaging railway simulation can be when every route brings a new challenge.\n\nKey Features:\n\t•\tDrive trains across 4 different cities with upgraded environments\n\t•\tChoose from 5 unique trains, each with its own style and feel\n\t•\tProgress through levels and improve your driving abilities\n\t•\tExplore redesigned subway routes and enhanced stations\n\n\nEnjoy a modern subway simulator that combines realistic train driving with upgraded locations, varied routes, and engaging progression — a deeper underground experience with every journey.\n",
